        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "HaptiX brings Taptic Engine feedback to every corner of iOS — hardware buttons, the keyboard, UI controls, SpringBoard gestures, and more. Fine-tune which interactions fire and dial in the exact feedback style that feels right.",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Haptic Style",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Choose from all five `UIImpactFeedbackGenerator` intensities:\n\n• **Light** — subtle, gentle tap\n• **Medium** — balanced, everyday feel\n• **Heavy** — firm, pronounced click\n• **Soft** — rounded, cushioned pulse\n• **Rigid** — sharp, mechanical snap",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Hardware & SpringBoard",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "• **Volume Buttons** — each press up or down\n• **Power Button** — single press\n• **Lock / Unlock Events** — screen lock from any source\n• **Homescreen Icons** — tap highlight on the home screen\n• **App Switcher & Gestures** — swipe-up and card transitions",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "App Interfaces (UIKit)",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "• **Keyboard Presses & Deletes** — every key tap and backspace\n• **Standard Buttons** — `UIControl` touch-up events across all apps\n• **UI Toggles & Switches** — `UISwitch` state changes\n• **Table / List Cells** — selection in any `UITableViewCell`\n• **Scroll Collision Edge** *(opt-in)* — fires when a `UIScrollView` reaches its top or bottom boundary while dragging",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Per-App Exclusions",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Blacklist any app via the **Excluded Apps** picker (powered by AltList). HaptiX disables itself automatically in those apps — no respring needed.",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Settings & Preferences",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "All toggles apply instantly via Darwin notifications — no respring, no delay. Preferences are read through `CFPreferencesCopyAppValue`, which bypasses the sandbox and works correctly in every injected process including native Apple apps.",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Compatibility",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**iOS 13 – 17**\n\n| Package | Jailbreak |\n|---|---|\n| `iphoneos-arm64` (rootless) | Dopamine 2, RootHide, palera1n rootless |\n| `iphoneos-arm` (rootful) | palera1n rootful |\n| `iphoneos-arm` legacy | Checkra1n, unc0ver, Electra (iOS 13–14) |",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
